,"bright":1,"img":"chara002_0","alpha":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"charaName":"【米托拉】","text":"[show]没有，滚。[l][hide][cm]","nameSide":"left"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_17"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"nonStandBright":false,"layer":"chara3","mirrow":true,"trans":false,"x":641,"noOut":false,"y":-229,"timeBak":300,"noIn":false,"transTime":0,"bright":1,"img":"npc_911_01","alpha":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara1","mirrow":false,"trans":true,"x":121,"noOut":false,"y":-289,"noIn":false,"transTime":300,"bright":0.6,"img":"chara002_0","alpha":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"charaName":"【萨克特】","text":"[show]哎呀。[r]总之呢，我们刚刚在北边的荒野执行任务。[r][l][cm]然后有几声巨大的咆哮不是，就突然窜出来一大堆角……角什么玩意儿的东西，就黄色的大毛怪。[l][cm]","nameSide":"right"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_45"}},{"key":"text","para":{"charaName":"【萨克特】","text":"[show]然后在下的契约主和伙伴们就都死掉了。[r][l]只剩在下一个人跑了回来，现在还被猪追着打，好惨。[l][hide]","nameSide":"right"}},{"key":"option","para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_18","text":"他们……都死了？"},{"tag":"tag_18","text":"说得这么轻松……"}]}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_18"}},{"key":"text","para":{"charaName":"【萨克特】","text":"[cm][show]那还能怎么地嘛。[r][l]只有我一个人逃了回来，连武器都给丢不见了。[l][cm]","nameSide":"right"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_19"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara3","mirrow":true,"trans":true,"x":641,"noOut":false,"y":-229,"noIn":false,"transTime":300,"bright":1,"img":"npc_911_01","alpha":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"charaName":"【萨克特】","text":"[show]不然凭我的身手，对付三四头野猪，也不算太——[l]咳咳、噢，好痛。！[l][hide][cm]","nameSide":"right"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_20"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara3","mirrow":true,"trans":true,"x":641,"noOut":false,"y":-229,"noIn":false,"transTime":300,"bright":0.6,"img":"npc_911_01","alpha":1}},{"key"